    "detailed_description": "<strong>Motherless - Season 1 includes:</strong> 11 chapters<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Season 1 is composed of over 10,000 renders, animated scenes, 178 videos, sounds and mini-games that you can play.<br></li><li>You can enjoy over 8 to 10 hours of gameplay totally free of charge!<br></li><li>Get your harem of beautiful women!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110110/extras/eb43c666a4cca47463bc460b329232f8.avif?t=1752863482\" /></div><br><br>Motherless is a captivating, narrative-driven visual novel intended for mature audiences.<br><br>It follows the story of Sunny, a young man who was separated from his loved ones at birth and raised with little knowledge of his origins.<br><br>Join him on a journey of self-discovery, as he reconnects with people from his past and uncovers the secrets of his forgotten\u00a0childhood.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110110/extras/b0168b7a7d73bc70a09dd8a9f2da6e59.avif?t=1752863482\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>In this game, you will witness the journey of a young boy who runs away from his private boarding school in search of his childhood memories. During this quest, he will unwittingly find employment with someone from his past...<br><br></li><li>You can play the intro or choose to ignore it... We recommend you play it!!!!<br><br></li><li>You will be able to choose through the relationship manager if you want to follow the path of any character.<br><br></li><li>The characters in the game have different ethnicities and personalities, so you will be attracted to some of them. Will you be able to ignore them?<br><br></li><li>The further you advance in the game, the more you will get caught up in the story and each character with their different needs.<br><br></li><li>The game is a visual novel that becomes more interactive through fun mini-games and hilariously awkward events.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110110/extras/87279420a539da47dbed8dc6d7a267b1.avif?t=1752863482\" /></div>",
